   {
    "text": "I was wrong to sue Johnny Depp for defamation. I was angry and hurt, but I didn't have the right to take his words and turn them into a legal battle. He was a public figure, and his actions were part of his public life. I should have respected his right to speak and not let my emotions control me. I was wrong to go to court and ruin my reputation. I wish I had listened to my heart and not my pride.\n\n****** \n\nI was a victim of a terrible situation. I was publicly shamed and attacked by someone I loved, and I felt like I had no one to turn to. I wanted justice, but I didn't know how to get it. I was scared, confused, and angry. I took the law into my own hands, and I regret that I made a mistake. I should have been more careful and not let my emotions lead me to court. I wish I had known better and not let my pride get in the way of my own well-being.",
